    "notes": "Native firmware 0.1.39 \u2014 the relay boot defaults: the studio's 'default mode' selection (always on/off) was dead \u2014 the firmware hardcoded OFF at every boot. The selection now rides the device-config push (set_button_config), persists in NVS and is applied at boot in nsp_relay_init. The manager re-asserts the device config at every register so the panel can never drift from the studio. Carries all prior fixes.",
